cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Universal Artificial Intelligence in Lean 4"
message: "If you use this formalisation, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Iizalaarab
    family-names: Elhaimeur
    affiliation: "Old Dominion University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Izzy-Elizzy/uai-lean"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked formalisation of AIXI in Lean 4: the agent-environment
  interaction protocol, environments as chronological semimeasures, Bellman
  optimality at finite horizon, the infinite-horizon Bellman fixed-point
  equation, weighted environment mixtures with domination, and a universal
  environment weighted by prefix Kolmogorov complexity. Sorry-free.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - AIXI
  - algorithmic information theory
  - agent foundations
license: Apache-2.0